n\",\n  \"summary\": \"Failure is a Gradle dependency-resolution conflict from a self-referential hibernate-platform BOM in hibernate-orm 8.0.0.Beta1's own published metadata (hibernate-spatial's relocation POM pulls in hibernate-platform, which itself manages hibernate-spatial's version), not something fixable via an extra dependency, Docker image, or test property.\",\n  \"deterministic_setup\": [],\n  \"agent_guidance\": \"\",\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"The Beta1 dependency graph may remain unresolvable by Gradle regardless of test setup until Hibernate publishes a fixed release; this is not a Native Image capability issue, so it should not be skipped — only attempted, and left to fail naturally if the upstream metadata bug persists.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":14869,"type":"result","duration_ms":132174,"uuid":"7c2e110e-9078-4163-9d9a-ff29bb8fd21e","ttft_stream_ms":1310,"time_to_request_ms":67,"first_content_frame_ms":1311,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}

